      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来因为心情郁闷，\n奇锐骏的状态并没有恢复……\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fe734999512444409a9d95c460fbfe51c4100aebadc20e65b0074bfc8739931",
