    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72bb602b46773651937e1004",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“从前从前，在某个地方，\n长出了一片很大的叶子。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b78f46f8e2ed744807781aeb820f6f60bd3e99416b8d88b50ec80782dead9dbc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
