    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ebad3f2e8a3a45905e1d434",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“至今为止，无论风怎么吹，\n叶子都丝毫不受影响。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "f772b39b5c8657fb77f38d926a8d9868895e4ef63d9ad38b3dbe0cad303716a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
